        <!-- Closing -->
        <div class="mt-16 bg-gray-900 text-white rounded-2xl p-8">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            For most buyers, the EcoFlow DELTA 3 Plus is the one to get: 1,024Wh of long-life LiFePO4 storage, an 1,800W inverter, fast AC charging and room to expand. If you will never add a battery, the DELTA 3 Classic does the same core job for less. If you need 2kWh on a budget, a discounted DELTA 2 Max is the value play.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Step up to the DELTA Pro 3 only if you plan to wire it into your home with a Smart Home Panel 2 or need 240V, and consider the DELTA Pro Ultra only for near-whole-home backup. For camping and device charging, the RIVER 3 Plus is the best carry-anywhere pick. Whatever you choose, match solar panels to the input limit and store the battery at a partial charge.
          </p>
